        "statement": "Optional labels inherit Other only when absent; explicit false, default and empty values retain their meaning across JSON and clone. Native verification covers classic SQL/GeoJSON styles and rendered pixels with configured local-vector-tiles explicitly excluded by render mode and source kind; it must not expand tile renderer capabilities.",
